          <h3 id="method-title">How the estimate works</h3>
          <p>For each tool and each month, take the smaller of observed unfilled reservations and the added units’ monthly capacity.</p>
          <span class="formula">Recovered = min(unfilled, added units × monthly rate)</span>
          <p style="margin-top: 9px">Sum those values across all tools and months. Each order uses whole units and costs $180 or less, including the option to buy nothing.</p>
          <p>The estimate uses the four historical months as a demand proxy for spring. The budget covers the listed unit prices.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
